2Ki 1:1 , Moab rebels;
2Ki 1:2 , Ahaziah, sending to Baal-zebub, hath his judgment by Elijah;
2Ki 1:5 , Elijah twice brings fire from heaven upon them whom Ahaziah sent to apprehend him;
2Ki 1:13 , He pities the third captain, and, encouraged by an angel, tells the king of his death;
2Ki 1:17 , Jehoram succeeds Ahaziah.
